      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S DIVA (2) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from five starts. Placed last time (22.25) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 5 lengths. Makes strong appeal on best. GOLDEN SPARKLES (7) has been in the money at her last two runs, most recently when second beaten 6 lengths (19.97). Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Can feature again. VAN NOSTRAND (1) was in the minors two back (20.14) at Capalaba but ran below best last time there, finishing 8th. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from eight starts. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. SPRING FABLE (4) won by a wide margin last start. Right in the mix.",
